<title>HONG KONG: Citybus new issue 18 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Citybus new issue 18 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong transportation company Citybus Group Ltd, the bus operation unit of CNT Group Ltd, said on Monday the public section of its initial public offer (IPO) of 166 million shares at HK$1.42 per share was 18.2 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The bus company offered 250 million shares at HK$1.42 per share earlier this month.</p>
<p>Some 84 million new issue were offered to existing shareholders and employees. The company said the 25 million offered to employees was fully subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
